{
  "id": "22180_kufuusuru",
  "headword": "{工夫|くふう}する",
  "reading": "くふうする",
  "romaji": "kufuusuru",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb (transitive)",
  "gloss": "to devise; to come up with an idea; to find a way",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to devise; to come up with a creative solution; to find a way; to think of a good idea",
      "explanation": "To use ingenuity and creative thinking to find a better way of doing something or to solve a problem. Implies thoughtful effort and resourcefulness."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "22180_kufuusuru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{料理|りょうり}の{仕方|しかた}を{工夫|くふう}する。",
      "english": "To come up with creative ways of cooking.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "22180_kufuusuru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{時間|じかん}を{有効|ゆうこう}に{使|つか}えるように{工夫|くふう}している。",
      "english": "I'm finding ways to use my time effectively.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "22180_kufuusuru_ex3",
      "japanese": "{子|こ}どもが{楽|たの}しく{勉強|べんきょう}できるように、{教|おし}え{方|かた}を{工夫|くふう}する{必要|ひつよう}がある。",
      "english": "We need to devise teaching methods so that children can study enjoyably.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "A very positive word implying resourcefulness, ingenuity, and making the best of a situation. The noun {工夫|くふう} alone means a clever idea or device.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {工夫|くふう}を{凝|こ}らす — to elaborate, to put great thought into\n- {工夫|くふう}を{重|かさ}ねる — to make repeated improvements\n- {工夫|くふう}{次第|しだい} — depending on how you work at it\n- いろいろ{工夫|くふう}する — to try various creative approaches\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {考|かんが}える — to think; general thinking, not specifically creative problem-solving\n- {発明|はつめい}する — to invent; implies creating something entirely new\n- アイデアを{出|だ}す — to come up with ideas; more casual",
